        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Day-ahead timeline.** Forecasts are issued at **09:00 UK time the day before**, ahead of the 09:20 EPEX gate closure. They cover the **power day, 23:00 to 23:00 UK time**. Use the time picker arrows to step a day at a time. Actual = Elexon market index price (APX), a proxy for the auction price."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Day-ahead price: $model forecast vs actual",
      "gridPos": {
